***In Whisk Things Continue To Happen***[@ the joke here is "In Which Things Continue To Happen", but we whisked it up a little bit. I suppose that's obvious.]


{Well, I’m sure you’re wondering...} what’s become of Officer Baba Waters and Blarte Canche, Malle Cop? Or perhaps you were thinking about our dear old pal, Manuel Ordinator Computer Gonzalez? Could it be that throughout this gripping action, you’ve been curious as to the whereabouts of Sonic, the just and lesbian mascot of the Flying Island Bitcoin Storage company? Maybe you want to know more about Lord Fitzthistlewits? [@ the concept of doing this bit again verbatim was mostly come up with by Conor, and the idea of leaving off the line that promises closure was come up with by me. ~M]

